. The chowder was excellent. Fries were covered with cheese, bacon and chowder. Not what I expected but still good. The shrimp required more work than worth the effort. The corn was delicious. Overall a good experience. We will be back to further explore the menu."}],"state":"CA"}", "original_answer": "Based on the provided structured data, Frankland's Crab is a restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, that offers a variety of dishes including desserts, seafood, food, salads, live/raw food, nightlife, cocktail bars, restaurants, and fish & chips. The business has a rating of 3.5 stars and receives generally positive reviews from customers.

